Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:18.33,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.65,0:01:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,28\N{\fnArial\fs30}28.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.14,0:01:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次遇见耶稣时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I first met him…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我的世界即将变得更广阔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus said that my world was gonna get a whole lot bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.82,0:01:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了那个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we found that world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,更广阔的世界属于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…"bigger world" is ours by right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人为它聚在了一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we've come together for it, all of us…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实不容置疑 那本就该属于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's that much more true … it's ours by right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.21,0:02:18.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（明天）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何崇尚和平公正的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any person who would live in peace and fairness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意找到共同之处的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would find common ground…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界也属于他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's their right, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些巧取豪夺 肆意杀戮 榨取利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those who use and take and kill to carve out the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,并独占世界的人们 我们要终结他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make it theirs alone … we end them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会为此庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't…celebrate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:03:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不会为此羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have shame about it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one person who has to die…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.21,0:03:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲手杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will kill him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果是那些人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it's the others…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些支持他 站在他那边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the others who prop him up, stand by his side,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至只是视而不见的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}even those who just look the other way …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,随他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,28\N{\fnArial\fs30}28.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后 我们继续开拓这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then… we keep making the world bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,齐心协力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,齐心协力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bound forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,引用莎翁的话 「今天谁和我同生共死\N{\fnArial\fs30}To quote The Bard, "For he today that sheds his blood with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁就是我的兄弟「\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall be my brother."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For she today…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是我的姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们练习过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've practiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,练了一遍又一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through it over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道计划不会止于今早\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know the plan doesn't end this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许得人心惶惶好多天\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we may have to live in uncertainty for days,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.35,0:04:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得信任彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we have to keep our faith in each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们坚持下去 凭借我们拥有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can hold on to that with everything we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来就是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the future is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界就是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 我是说 我有事 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I-I'm okay. I mean… I'm not, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被枪打过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been shot at.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,被丢过微波炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone threw a microwave at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就说两句我妈妈常说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I-I'm just gonna say something my mom used to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.85,0:09:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能有个好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hope for the best here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「无论你有什么好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Whatever you have of good,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们分给旅人「\N{\fnArial\fs30}spend on the traveler."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈说过 帮助那些旅人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom said that … that helping the traveler,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些无家可归的人 是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the person without a home … that's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信你目睹过不少事 遇到过不少事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you've seen things, been through things,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不信任他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you don't trust people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不相信别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也遇过不少事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been through things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈 她还说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom … she also said that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「愿我的仁慈胜过我的怒火」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"May my mercy prevail over my wrath."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不全是我妈妈说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not all my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:57.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,那…那句是《古兰经》里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one… That's from the Quran.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:09:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我不该这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至都不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我…我好几天没吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I ha… I haven't eaten in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至可能是我的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might not even be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.81,0:10:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…想讨点食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted some … e-even just some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.89,0:10:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来应该在十字路口见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to meet at the intersection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.61,0:10:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是冲他头顶开的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot over his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想赶他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted him gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that he was …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见他说了什么 听见了大部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard what he said. Most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.51,0:10:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他可能是他们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he could've been one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是间谍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是冲他头顶开的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot above his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:10:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他不是他们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he isn't one of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:10:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他能挺过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope he makes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不够的 爸爸 - 什么不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not?gonna be enough, Dad. - Enough what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:35.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（哨站 平台/树上 道森高速路二分之一处）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:06.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（周边住宅区 雷耶斯街3000号段）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:34.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（佩茨工业研究所 博克路/化工厂）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:40.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（研究所）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:59.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杂草丛生的路边房子）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,30分钟 大家都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 minutes. Everyone's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.39,0:13:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼下的处境是由一个人造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one person who brought it to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事都会有一个人挑头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always starts with one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在这里做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we're doing here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This … This isn't about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 的确不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确保了这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想和他一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you wanted to go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.84,0:15:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,太煎熬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会协助你保卫这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll help you defend this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 协助我 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就靠你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you up to, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为能打败我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?you're gonna take us on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}beggin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 你就等着再求饶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna beg again, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的儿子死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your … Your boy's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.71,0:17:13.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杂草丛生的路边房子 奥斯汀 侦察队）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来的人真多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure are a lot of us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 我俩不过刚认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You just met me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人都是刚认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all just met each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在祈祷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you praying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,正准备开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always meant to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比不祈祷强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better late than never.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,护住胸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over your sternum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 我等会儿就和玛姬一起回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm going back with Maggie after.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. Sternum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duuuuuude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说服了山顶寨抵抗救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the Hilltop to stand against the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.97,0:19:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少打完头阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least for the first part.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们说妊娠中期也可以打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say you can wage war through the second trimester.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,从农场那时起我就一直在抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been fighting since the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.17,0:19:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经停不下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那明天呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.27,0:19:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你设想过明天的情形吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You been thinking about what that looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.41,0:19:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道能不能等得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I can wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需再战一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one more fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我要在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少打完头阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least for the first part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说山顶寨的医生被抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm told the Hilltop lost their doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.27,0:20:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是位产科医生 神之国有医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}An obstetrician, no less. We have a doctor in the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是位很有才华的女性 加入我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman of talent. Join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会守好背后的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get ours back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.39,0:20:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会守好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像白天一定会战胜黑夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}As sure as the day defeats the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.11,0:20:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今天开始 我们要重塑这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on this day, ?we begin to reshape this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你的子子孙孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your child?and the children to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你是山顶寨的幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilltop's lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你教会了我如何成为值得被追随的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You showed me how to be someone worth following.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,此战过后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After this…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm following you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.09,0:21:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.77,0:21:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,十…\N{\fnArial\fs30}10…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,九…\N{\fnArial\fs30}9…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,八…\N{\fnArial\fs30}8…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,七…六…\N{\fnArial\fs30}7…6…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,五…\N{\fnArial\fs30}5…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.77,0:21:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,四…\N{\fnArial\fs30}4…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,三…\N{\fnArial\fs30}3…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.29,0:21:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}2…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.65,0:21:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}1.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.48,0:21:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.01,0:21:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还算准时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.07,0:21:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}?Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.32,0:21:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.00,0:22:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们走向了尸道\N{\fnArial\fs30}?It went up towards the herdway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.73,0:22:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,多派点人 两辆车 十支枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go big. 2 cars, 10 guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能出乱子 现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not messing around, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,走姐妹路 被封锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the Sister route. It's locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.08,0:22:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是他们干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think it was them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.95,0:22:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.95,0:22:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计是以前的老东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably something left over,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能压在尸体下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe under one of the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要大动静 德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want some bang bang, Dwighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要听到尖叫 我要尝到血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want some scream scream. I want blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.65,0:23:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你会如愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll get lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有多接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}How close are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.29,0:23:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.42,0:25:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.32,0:25:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.27,0:25:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚在开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.18,0:26:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把闹钟关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned off the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.35,0:26:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一上午不去他们不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can manage without you for one morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.81,0:26:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天大家都旷工\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all playing hooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.71,0:26:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.66,0:26:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那首歌不是我放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I didn't put that song on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.02,0:26:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.81,0:26:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.86,0:26:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚在开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.04,0:26:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你们把小挡泥板都带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you got your little mudflaps with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.41,0:27:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在觉得我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm not exactly feelin' a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.46,0:27:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么必要互相开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}for us to try throwin' lead at each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.41,0:27:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在乎我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care about my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.23,0:27:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想随便派他们上战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to just march them into the line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了证明「我老二比你们大」\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I want play "My dick is bigger than yours."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.56,0:27:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实比你们大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.52,0:27:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.26,0:27:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就算我不是最大的 我也能欣然接受现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm also comfortable enough to accept the fact if it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.86,0:27:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定不会为了争这鸟事 送我的人去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certainly not gonna let my people die over that shit…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.03,0:27:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like you're about to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.05,0:27:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢 瑞克 我他妈能为你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Rick, what the hell can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.76,0:27:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.17,0:27:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫西蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name's Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.11,0:28:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.32,0:28:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.93,0:28:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞吉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regina.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.73,0:28:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克 我不得不… - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick, ?I'd feel remiss if … - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.99,0:28:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.89,0:28:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 你们五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you five.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.97,0:28:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的救世军们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.96,0:28:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人仍有机会活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you have a chance to survive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.36,0:28:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃过这一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}To survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.88,0:28:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要投降 你们都能活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all can live if you surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.46,0:28:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了此刻 就无法保证了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't guarantee it any time but now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.55,0:28:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.73,0:28:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.34,0:28:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它会引爆吗 - 我去处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could that thing set it off? - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.76,0:29:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they surrender…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.49,0:29:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的小小巡逻队就饶他们一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you and your little piss patrol doesn't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.62,0:29:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来真划算啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like a good deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.62,0:29:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎么办 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.32,0:29:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过 两遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.03,0:29:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.63,0:29:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.68,0:29:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do know what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.50,0:29:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.17,0:29:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道接下来会变得有多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea the shit that's about to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.24,0:29:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something, Rick …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.99,0:29:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你这次大战人数够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you have the numbers for this fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.39,0:29:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.47,0:29:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.27,0:30:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然是去了那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course that's where he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.98,0:30:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.61,0:30:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和小小巡逻队有什么要说 格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Rick?and the piss patrol, Gregory?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.45,0:30:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,山顶寨支持尼根和救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hilltop stands?with Negan and the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.50,0:30:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何山顶寨的居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any resident of the Hilltop who takes up arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.63,0:30:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,若敢拿起武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}or who supports this ultimatum.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.19,0:30:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或支持威胁救世堂或救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the Sanctuary or any of the Saviors, for that matter …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.52,0:30:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,本殖民地将不再欢迎他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will no longer be welcome in the colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.62,0:30:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.94,0:30:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的家人也会被一同驱逐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their families will be thrown out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.67,0:30:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面自生自灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will be left to fend for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.70,0:30:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.06,0:31:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.40,0:31:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁现在还有家可回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you won't have a home to go back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.15,0:31:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想做什么就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.33,0:31:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在山顶寨只有一堆书和吃龙虾的破围嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I have at the Hilltop are a bunch of books and an old lobster bib.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.20,0:31:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到他的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.19,0:31:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去继续他妈的分拣小麦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to separating wheat and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.23,0:31:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者鬼晓得你们这些人做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}or whatever the hell it is you people do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.01,0:31:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来没人要走 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't look like anyone's goin', does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.39,0:31:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,山顶寨支持…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilltop stands with …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.09,0:31:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,山顶寨支持玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hilltop stands with Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.89,0:32:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.65,0:32:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你付出了很多心血\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I invested a lot in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.43,0:32:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的非常非常失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am very, very disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.81,0:32:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来战事一触即发了 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like?shit is goin' down, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.67,0:33:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的几个副手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You "Lieutenants…"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.00,0:33:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可得想好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to make up your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.14,0:33:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我们先暂停一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can take a time-out here …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.78,0:33:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 必须是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This has to happen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.73,0:33:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.78,0:33:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要逼我倒数吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna make me count.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.11,0:33:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.80,0:33:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.30,0:33:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.21,0:33:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,十\N{\fnArial\fs30}10!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,九\N{\fnArial\fs30}9!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.22,0:33:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnArial\fs30}8!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.21,0:33:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,七\N{\fnArial\fs30}7!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.19,0:34:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.11,0:34:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 总会走到这一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It was always gonna be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.87,0:34:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴与你们合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure doing business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.43,0:34:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.57,0:34:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.37,0:34:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.12,0:34:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 会很好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, this is gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.02,0:34:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.22,0:34:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,总好过坐以待毙 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better than lettin' things be, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.82,0:35:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.97,0:35:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.52,0:36:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.22,0:37:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.49,0:37:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.97,0:37:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.97,0:37:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick! We have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.27,0:37:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.17,0:37:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 他跑不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!?He's not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.84,0:37:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得撤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.76,0:37:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为了你 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.65,0:37:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.90,0:38:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.83,0:38:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.37,0:38:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.31,0:38:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救你出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.57,0:38:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需等待时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to wait for our moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.31,0:38:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.89,0:38:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢上帝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.37,0:39:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.35,0:39:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹 离我们很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}The … The … The shots … they're too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.34,0:39:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么朝我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they firing at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.85,0:39:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.91,0:39:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.50,0:39:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.97,0:39:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.89,0:40:20.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（对不起）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.00,0:40:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能再等会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can wait some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.18,0:40:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.42,0:41:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫走了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stopped to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.54,0:41:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.00,0:41:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.46,0:41:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.44,0:41:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试图杀他 加百利叫走了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to kill him, and Gabriel stopped to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.71,0:41:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得动身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta start out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.27,0:41:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.79,0:41:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.24,0:41:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.79,0:41:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.88,0:41:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本打算用弓箭干掉守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were gonna start with taking out the guards with arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.06,0:41:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得隔着尸群你还能射中吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can still hit them through that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.18,0:41:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很有把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't bet on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.27,0:42:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.20,0:43:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你穿着拉屎裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you got your shitting pants on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.90,0:43:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.59,0:43:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉屎裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your shittin' pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.14,0:43:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你现在穿着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're wearing them right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.26,0:43:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…'cause you…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.23,0:43:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要拉裤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are about to shit your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.79,0:44:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.10,0:44:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们为派对做了个大猫头鹰 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They made a big owl for the party! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.95,0:44:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家对这个节日极为认真\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are taking this festival extremely seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.71,0:44:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大猫头鹰\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big owl?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.31,0:44:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's outside.?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.24,0:44:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会抓到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.58,0:44:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不会 我们去看看好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never. Should we go see?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.22,0:45:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不怕大猫头鹰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid of a big owl.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.31,0:45:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.12,0:45:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mercy…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.96,0:45:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜过\N{\fnArial\fs30}prevails…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.47,0:45:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}over my wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.91,0:45:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to wait for it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.05,0:45:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也不用等 是的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't either … Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.82,0:45:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们不用等\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we don't have to wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.91,0:45:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们明天就开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we start tomorrow right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.55,0:46:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭着我们战胜的困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}with everything we've beaten,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.69,0:46:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们承受的苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything we've endured,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.59,0:46:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们度过的难关 我们至今的成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything we've risen above, everything we've become…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.01,0:46:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们明天就开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we start tomorrow right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.77,0:46:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管接下来遇到什么 我们都赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what comes next… we've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.62,0:46:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've already won.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.09,0:46:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fad（700，700）\an8\fs23\b1\bord1\pos（192，185.728）}纪念约翰·博奈克
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.47,0:46:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fad（700，700）\an8\fs23\b1\bord1\pos（192，186.546）}纪念乔治·罗梅罗
